# B10 (listing 7151-7207): Mode13 on ControlBallDrained with MultiballCount != 1 does nothing: mode 13 stays on
# and its text is not cleared. Three captures in mode 2 start mode 13 with 3 balls in play (B1); one drain leaves 3 != 1.
init fixed_dt 10
init seed 1
10 key down new_game
11 key up new_game
200 poke info_text_box message_field 2
210 event s_hole19 ControlBallCaptured
230 event s_hole19 ControlBallCaptured
250 event s_hole19 ControlBallCaptured
250 expect mode == 13
250 expect multiball == 3
260 event drain ControlBallDrained
270 expect mode == 13
270 expect multiball == 3
270 expect none text info_text_box clear
300 quit
